WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:05.400
Fans and friends were clearly devastated to
hear about the death of "Power Rangers" actor

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:07.223
Jason David Frank.

00:00:07.223 --> 00:00:12.880
Here's just a small sample of how they mourned
his passing on social media.

00:00:12.880 --> 00:00:18.680
Jason David Frank's representative confirmed
to TMZ that the actor has died at age 49,

00:00:18.680 --> 00:00:21.260
and is survived by his four children.

00:00:21.260 --> 00:00:25.710
The news of the "Power Rangers" icon's death
has come as a shock to millions of fans around

00:00:25.710 --> 00:00:31.383
the world, who tuned in over the last three
decades to see Frank's portrayal of Tommy Oliver.

00:00:31.383 --> 00:00:36.630
The character first debuted as the Green Ranger
in "Mighty Morphin Power Rangers," the first

00:00:36.630 --> 00:00:40.840
series in the "Power Rangers" franchise, in
1993.

00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:46.270
Originally a villain under the spell of Rita
Repulsa, Oliver later joined the titular team,

00:00:46.270 --> 00:00:48.440
deciding to use his powers for good.

00:00:48.507 --> 00:00:49.507
"What have I done?"

00:00:49.627 --> 00:00:51.410
"What you did, you did under Rita's influence.

00:00:52.411 --> 00:00:53.873
You own the power now."

00:00:53.873 --> 00:00:59.559
While his intentions were positive, the Green
Ranger was sometimes rebellious, causing friction

00:00:59.559 --> 00:01:01.579
and clashing with his fellow Rangers.

00:01:01.579 --> 00:01:06.640
The character later achieved legendary status
when he assumed the role of the mythical White

00:01:06.640 --> 00:01:10.200
Ranger, becoming the formal leader of the
team.

00:01:10.200 --> 00:01:14.790
Arguably the most popular and beloved "Power
Rangers" character of all time, audiences

00:01:14.790 --> 00:01:20.720
were fascinated with how Frank added nuance
to an already tortured and multifaceted character.

00:01:20.720 --> 00:01:26.270
It also helped that Oliver's Green Ranger
was the epitome of cool in the early '90s,

00:01:26.270 --> 00:01:30.299
with young viewers obsessed with his charisma
and lone-wolf mentality.

00:01:30.299 --> 00:01:34.799
After "Mighty Morphin Power Rangers" ended,
Frank returned more than a dozen times as

00:01:34.799 --> 00:01:39.200
Tommy Oliver in spin-offs, becoming the anchor
character for the franchise.

00:01:39.200 --> 00:01:43.180
He even had a small cameo in the 2017 live-action
film.

00:01:43.180 --> 00:01:47.951
The star's final appearance as the beloved
Green Ranger was in 2018's "Power Rangers

00:01:47.951 --> 00:01:49.500
Super Ninja Steel."

00:01:49.500 --> 00:01:55.389
"Who better to destroy the real Tommy Oliver
than me?"

00:01:55.389 --> 00:01:56.899
"Take your best shot."

00:01:56.899 --> 00:02:01.770
Generations of "Power Rangers" fans have grown
up watching Frank as Tommy Oliver, making

00:02:01.770 --> 00:02:03.360
the actor's loss all the more devastating.

00:02:03.360 --> 00:02:08.720
As the news of Frank's passing made its way
throughout various pockets of the internet,

00:02:08.720 --> 00:02:13.650
the "Power Rangers" fandom couldn't help but
emphasize and celebrate the actor's legacy.

00:02:13.716 --> 00:02:14.929
One Twitter user wrote,

00:02:25.069 --> 00:02:29.989
Echoing similar sentiments, another person
tweeted just how unique the character was,

00:02:29.989 --> 00:02:35.210
pointing out how the Green Ranger was "a menace"
in his early appearances, causing new stresses

00:02:35.210 --> 00:02:36.713
for the Power Rangers.

00:02:36.713 --> 00:02:38.093
The fan continued,

00:02:45.100 --> 00:02:46.100
Another fan tweeted,

00:02:57.076 --> 00:03:00.930
Other users shared their grief by celebrating
his legacy.

00:03:00.930 --> 00:03:04.849
One listed off all the many colors of Power
Ranger Tommy had been, tweeting,

00:03:11.930 --> 00:03:16.519
On the "Power Rangers" fan subreddit, one
user couldn't quantify the impact the Green

00:03:16.519 --> 00:03:19.050
Ranger had on popular culture, writing,

00:03:28.799 --> 00:03:33.230
While fans continue to mourn the loss of the
beloved actor, those who worked with the Green

00:03:33.230 --> 00:03:38.409
Ranger on "Mighty Morphin Power Rangers" also
took the opportunity to express their grief

00:03:38.409 --> 00:03:40.019
and discuss Frank's legacy.

00:03:40.019 --> 00:03:44.003
Walter Jones, who played the original Black
Ranger, told TMZ,

00:03:52.480 --> 00:03:56.939
Amy Jo Johnson, who played the Pink Ranger
and Tommy Oliver's love interest, took to

00:03:56.939 --> 00:04:01.290
Instagram to share a selfie of the two sat
at a fan convention.

00:04:01.290 --> 00:04:02.290
She wrote,

00:04:16.430 --> 00:04:20.660
Several celebrities from other corners of
the entertainment industry expressed their

00:04:20.660 --> 00:04:22.270
sense of loss as well.

00:04:22.270 --> 00:04:24.690
"Minions" screenwriter Brian Lynch tweeted,

00:04:33.537 --> 00:04:37.980
"Evil Dead" icon Bruce Campbell also took
to Twitter to remember how he and Frank grew

00:04:37.980 --> 00:04:40.690
close while on the convention circuit, writing,

00:04:40.690 --> 00:04:47.239
"We enjoyed the crappy coffee, smoking stogies
on the loading dock and dressing up in whacky outfits.

00:04:47.239 --> 00:04:51.983
Jason's loss is another reminder to appreciate
the ones you're with – right now."

